    "detailed_description": "Ever wondered what mischief cats get up to on the roof? Well, they're not just lazing around \u2013 they're hosting the ultimate rooftop jam session! Picture this: jazz, rock, samba and a whole lot more. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748050/extras/ee7d61ccd0390b2cf2cb179924a73278.poster.avif?t=1711726368\" width=600 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748050/extras/ee7d61ccd0390b2cf2cb179924a73278.webm?t=1711726368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748050/extras/ee7d61ccd0390b2cf2cb179924a73278.mp4?t=1711726368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Innovative features like adaptive music, different game modes and a dog that mess the things up.<br></li><li>Classic mode, Dog Challenge mode, High Score or Low Score modes.<br></li><li>Dynamic, interactive songs that evolve with the gameplay, composed exclusively for the game.<br></li><li>Four different levels with unique and original music.<br></li><li>Hand-drawn artwork and animations for a visually captivating experience.<br></li><li>Global leaderboards.<br></li><li>Challenging achievements.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748050/extras/f4bf1339395e50aae1d8c60060222eb4.poster.avif?t=1711726368\" width=600 height=110 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748050/extras/f4bf1339395e50aae1d8c60060222eb4.webm?t=1711726368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748050/extras/f4bf1339395e50aae1d8c60060222eb4.mp4?t=1711726368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Your mission is to skillfully match the feline musicians, summoning new talents while dodging overflow and contending with an occasional canine disruptor. Oh, and the climax? Brace yourself for a mind-blowing guitar solo on the final cat. Are you up for the challenge? The purr-fect musical adventure awaits!",
    "about_the_game": "Ever wondered what mischief cats get up to on the roof? Well, they're not just lazing around \u2013 they're hosting the ultimate rooftop jam session! Picture this: jazz, rock, samba and a whole lot more. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748050/extras/ee7d61ccd0390b2cf2cb179924a73278.poster.avif?t=1711726368\" width=600 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748050/extras/ee7d61ccd0390b2cf2cb179924a73278.webm?t=1711726368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748050/extras/ee7d61ccd0390b2cf2cb179924a73278.mp4?t=1711726368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Innovative features like adaptive music, different game modes and a dog that mess the things up.<br></li><li>Classic mode, Dog Challenge mode, High Score or Low Score modes.<br></li><li>Dynamic, interactive songs that evolve with the gameplay, composed exclusively for the game.<br></li><li>Four different levels with unique and original music.<br></li><li>Hand-drawn artwork and animations for a visually captivating experience.<br></li><li>Global leaderboards.<br></li><li>Challenging achievements.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748050/extras/f4bf1339395e50aae1d8c60060222eb4.poster.avif?t=1711726368\" width=600 height=110 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748050/extras/f4bf1339395e50aae1d8c60060222eb4.webm?t=1711726368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748050/extras/f4bf1339395e50aae1d8c60060222eb4.mp4?t=1711726368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Your mission is to skillfully match the feline musicians, summoning new talents while dodging overflow and contending with an occasional canine disruptor. Oh, and the climax? Brace yourself for a mind-blowing guitar solo on the final cat. Are you up for the challenge? The purr-fect musical adventure awaits!",
    "short_description": "What do cats do on the roof? They play jazz, rock, metal and more! In this Suika-like game, you must match the cats to make new musicians appear, all while avoiding overflow and dealing with a crazy dog that shows up to mess things up. Will you be able to hear a killer guitar solo on the last cat?",
